;===============================================================
; Target: Volumetric Light (3D) v3.14 (VolumetricLight3D.obj2)
; Language: English
; Place this file in  Language\  (e.g. C:\ProgramData\aviutl2\Language\)
;===============================================================

[Language]
Information=Volumetric Light (3D) v3.14 English Language Pack
SubLanguage=English

[Effect]
VolumetricLight3D=Volumetric Light (3D)

[VolumetricLight3D]
体積光（3D）=Volumetric Light (3D)

; --- 形 -> Beam Shape ---
形=Beam Shape
光源レイヤー=Source Layer
光の出方=Ray Mode
平行=Parallel
放射=Radiate
収束=Converge
光の中身=Fill Style
体積光=Volumetric
ベタ=Flat Solid
方向=Direction
手前角度=Forward Tilt
画面基準=Screen-Space Dir
拡散角度=Spread Angle
光源X=Light X
光源Y=Light Y
光源Z=Light Z
長さ=Length
減衰=Falloff

; --- 光 -> Light & Color ---
光=Light & Color
光の色=Light Color (Opt)
強さ=Intensity
しきい値=Threshold
カメラ光源連携=Camera 3D Light Sync
自動(白飛び防止・推奨)=Auto (Anti-Overexposure, Rec.)
カメラ光源に追従(座標・色)=Follow Camera Light (Pos & Color)
カメラ3D照明を無効化(純自発光)=Suppress Camera Light (Pure Emissive)
そのまま受光(補正なし)=Off (Raw Lighting)

; --- 遮蔽設定 -> Occlusion (Shadow Shafts) ---
遮蔽設定=Occlusion (Shadow Shafts)
前景遮蔽=Foreground Occlusion
なし=Off
3D影のみ(物理遮光)=3D Shadow Shafts Only
前景マスクのみ=Foreground Silhouette Mask Only
3D影＋前景マスク(推奨)=3D Shadow + Foreground Mask (Rec.)
3Dオブジェクト処理=3D Object Mode
自動(VRM輪郭保護＋OBJ前後遮蔽)=Auto (VRM Holdout + OBJ Depth)
物理前後遮蔽(手前の光を透過)=Physical 3D Depth (Keep Front Beam)
輪郭くっきり保護(手前の光をカット)=Crisp Holdout (Cut Front Beam)
3Dオブジェクトを除外(2Dのみ)=Ignore 3D Objects (2D Only)
遮蔽対象=Occluder Scope
前方の全レイヤー自動検出=Auto (All Foreground Layers)
光源〜本レイヤー間を自動=Auto (Between Source & Self)
レイヤー番号を指定=Specify Layer Numbers
指定レイヤー=Occluder Layers
影の柔らかさ=Shadow Softness
遮蔽の強さ=Shadow Strength

; --- 前景なじませ -> Foreground Blend ---
前景なじませ=Foreground Blend
前景なじませを有効化=Enable Foreground Blend
なじませ対象=Blend Target Scope
前方の2Dレイヤー自動=Auto (All Foreground 2D Layers)
範囲・番号を指定=Specify Layer Range / Numbers
対象レイヤー指定=Target Layer Range
ベース明るさ=Base Brightness
カラーモード=Color Pickup Mode
単色=Single Color
2色(左右)=Dual Color (Left/Right)
体積光＋背景2色連動(推奨)=Volumetric + Scene Dual Sync (Rec.)
ライトスタイル=Rim Light Style
グラデーション(逆光)=Gradient Wrap (Backlight)
グラデーション(通常)=Gradient Fill (Normal)
輪郭リム(縁取り)=Outline Rim (Edge Highlight)
ライト強さ=Rim Light Strength
拡散幅=Light Diffusion
偏り(外⇔内)=Bias (Outer <-> Inner)
自然補正=Natural Color Tune
彩度=Rim Saturation
背景明るさ連動=Scene Brightness Link
環境なじませ量=Environment Blend
環境ぼかし=Environment Blur

; --- 霧の設定 -> Internal Fog & Noise ---
霧の設定=Internal Fog & Noise
霧=Fog Amount
霧の大きさ=Fog Scale
風向き=Wind Angle
風の速さ=Wind Speed
シード=Random Seed

; --- 品質 -> Quality & Display ---
品質=Quality & Display
解像度=Resolution
高精細=High
標準=Standard
軽量(1/2)=Lightweight (1/2)
自動動的精度=Auto Dynamic Precision
スライス数=Slice Count
視点追従=Slice Alignment
自動(編集視点対応)=Auto (3D Camera & Edit View)
横視点(X軸)=Side Slices (X-Axis)
画面に状態表示=Show Status HUD
ログに出力=Log to Console

[Tips.体積光（3D）]
effect.name=3D volumetric light (god-ray) custom object (v3.14 for AviUtl2 v2.1.15+), featuring optional Foreground Blend (AutoBlendLight 3D integration). Paired with VL3DBridge.aux2 (v1.21) GPU hardware shadow rasterization and lock-free read bridge for 2D layers and 3D models (.obj / .vrm), 3D camera light sync, and natural edge-light blending.
光源レイヤー=Select the layer number used as the light source (image, video, text, shape, or custom object; 0 = unselected, or emits directly from a Camera Control 3D light when Follow Camera Light is active).
光の出方=Select beam geometry: Parallel, Radiate (expanding outward from a virtual 3D focal point), or Converge.
光の中身=Volumetric renders soft atmospheric Tyndall rays; Flat Solid renders crisp stylized solid beams.
方向=In-plane projection angle in degrees when Ray Mode is Parallel.
手前角度=3D tilt angle pitching the beam forward toward the viewer in Parallel mode.
画面基準=When enabled, Direction is evaluated in screen space; when off, relative to the source layer's local axes.
拡散角度=Cone spread angle in Parallel mode: 0 deg = parallel shaft, positive expands outward, negative converges inward.
光源X=X offset of the virtual 3D focal point in Radiate or Converge mode (pixels).
光源Y=Y offset of the virtual 3D focal point in Radiate or Converge mode (pixels).
光源Z=Z distance between the virtual 3D focal point and the source layer plane.
長さ=Total 3D extension length of the light shaft in pixels.
減衰=Distance falloff along the shaft (0% = uniform brightness, higher values fade smoothly toward the tip).
光の色=Leave empty/cleared to preserve the source layer's original per-pixel colors; pick a color to tint the entire beam.
強さ=Overall volumetric light intensity (%).
しきい値=Luminance threshold for extracting bright regions from the source layer (0% = full layer emits, higher = brightest highlights only).
カメラ光源連携=Coordinates how Camera Control 3D lights affect volumetric slices: prevent overexposure, follow a camera 3D light's position and color, or suppress surface lighting interference.
前景遮蔽=Select foreground occlusion mode: Off, 3D Shadow Shafts Only, Foreground Silhouette Mask Only, or 3D Shadow + Foreground Mask (Recommended).
3Dオブジェクト処理=Controls how .obj and .vrm 3D models interact with the beam: Auto (VRM Holdout + OBJ Depth), Physical 3D Depth, Crisp Holdout, or Ignore 3D Objects.
遮蔽対象=Automatically detect all foreground layers, layers between Source and Self, or specify exact layer numbers.
指定レイヤー=Enter occluder layer numbers; supports spaces, commas, and ranges (e.g. 4 5 or 2,4-6, up to 8 layers).
影の柔らかさ=Penumbra softness along cast 3D shadow shaft edges.
遮蔽の強さ=Shadow opacity inside occluded regions (100% = full shadow occlusion).
前景なじませを有効化=Harmoniously blends selected foreground 2D layers into the background and 3D volumetric light environment (integrated from AutoBlendLight by nctype, MIT License). Off by default.
なじませ対象=Blend all foreground 2D layers automatically, or restrict blending to specific layer numbers/ranges so UI, subtitles, or overlays stay untouched.
対象レイヤー指定=Layer numbers or ranges to blend (e.g. 4-5 or 3,5,7-9). Closer non-target 2D overlays and 3D models are automatically protected.
ベース明るさ=Adjusts base brightness of target foreground layers (default 85%; slightly lowering base brightness in backlit or dark scenes helps edge lighting look natural).
カラーモード=Single Color, Left/Right Dual Color, or Volumetric + Scene Dual Sync (Recommended: samples directional volumetric beam and scene colors).
ライトスタイル=Gradient Wrap (Backlight), Gradient Fill (Normal), or Outline Rim (crisp edge highlight).
ライト強さ=Overall rim and light-wrap intensity (0-200%).
拡散幅=Width of inward light wrap or contour highlight (0-200).
偏り(外⇔内)=Shifts light balance between outer glow (-100) and inner wrap (+100).
自然補正=Tames excessive saturation and harsh color casts for natural cinematic lighting (0 = raw sample, 100 = balanced natural tune, 200 = neutral soft white).
彩度=Adjusts color saturation of the rim/wrap light (0-200%).
背景明るさ連動=Automatically scales rim light strength according to surrounding scene and volumetric beam brightness.
環境なじませ量=Blends blurred surrounding scene and beam colors into the foreground layer (0-100%).
環境ぼかし=Spatial blur radius of the sampled environment color field (0-500).
霧=Adds drifting 3D smoke/dust texture inside the light shaft (0% = smooth clean beam).
霧の大きさ=3D spatial scale of internal fog/dust texture in pixels.
風向き=Drift direction angle of internal fog/dust in degrees.
風の速さ=Drift speed of internal fog/dust in pixels/second.
シード=Random seed for the internal 3D fog/dust pattern.
解像度=GPU volume slice atlas and 3D shadow map resolution preset.
自動動的精度=Automatically scales slice count continuously (64-192) based on beam depth.
スライス数=Manual slice count used when Auto Dynamic Precision is turned off (16-64).
視点追従=Aligns volume slices automatically to the 3D Camera Control and Editor View, or along the X-axis.
画面に状態表示=Displays a live status HUD at top-left (GPU mode, atlas size, slice count, occluders, and cache usage; automatically hidden during video export).
ログに出力=Outputs current render status and diagnostic summary to the AviUtl2 Log window.

